<br/></span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: ; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">(f)</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: ; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Growth capital</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: ; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">(g)</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: ; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td colspan="2" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Horse power</span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: ; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">(h)</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: ; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Active directory of Information Technology users</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap" class=""><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: ; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Note:</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: ; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Modified Massachusetts Formula ("MMF") is a   combination of revenues, property, and direct labor costs</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">to create an allocation base. The company uses an adjusted   MMF that utilizes a combination of gross</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">margin (33%), gross property (33%), and direct labor (33%)   costs to create its allocation base.</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Supervisory Control and Data Acquisition ("SCADA")   is the application used by Gas/Pipeline Control to monitor</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">real time data and alarms on the system.</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/