mpany, an affiliated   company of Gulf Run, only processes the payroll</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">for associated/affiliated companies and directly bills to   Gulf Run the salaries, benefits and payroll taxes</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td> </tr> <tr style="height: 15.75pt">  <td height="21" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15.75pt"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">of associated/affiliated company employees for services   provided by them to Gulf Run.</span></span></td>  <td style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br/></span></span></td> </tr></table><p><br/></p></div></link:footnote>
